  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "q3-03",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Q3a — explicit schema, timestamp cast, `selisih_byte`, temp view\n",
    "\n",
    "`from_json` with an **explicit** `StructType` (no schema inference anywhere): the schema is\n",
    "declared once, so a malformed payload becomes a `null` struct instead of silently changing\n",
    "the shape of the data. `timestamp` arrives as Unix **seconds** (`LongType`), so it is cast\n",
    "to `TimestampType`; `selisih_byte = length.new − coalesce(length.old, 0)`.\n",
    "\n",
    "Two edge cases the case study hints at, handled explicitly and reported:\n",
    "`length.old` is `null` for pages created by the event (coalesce → 0, so a create shows its\n",
    "full page size as the delta). The raw Wikimedia feed omits `length` entirely on `log` and\n",
    "`categorize` events; the Q1 producer normalises that to a `length` struct with `null`\n",
    "fields, so those rows keep `selisih_byte = null` instead of a fake 0 — the counts below show\n",
    "exactly how many rows fall into each case.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 3,
   "id": "q3-04",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "struct<id:bigint,type:string,wiki:string,server_name:string,title:string,namespace:int,user:string,bot:boolean,minor:boolean,timestamp:bigint,comment:string,length:struct<old:bigint,new:bigint>>\n",
      "kafka messages read : 57,778\n",
      "null/unparsable     : 0\n",
      "rows in the snapshot: 57,778\n",
      "\n",
      "--- schema after the transformation (note event_ts: timestamp, selisih_byte: bigint) ---\n",
      "root\n",
      " |-- id: long (nullable = true)\n",
      " |-- type: string (nullable = true)\n",
      " |-- wiki: string (nullable = true)\n",
      " |-- server_name: string (nullable = true)\n",
      " |-- title: string (nullable = true)\n",
      " |-- namespace: integer (nullable = true)\n",
      " |-- user: string (nullable = true)\n",
      " |-- bot: boolean (nullable = true)\n",
      " |-- minor: boolean (nullable = true)\n",
      " |-- timestamp: long (nullable = true)\n",
      " |-- comment: string (nullable = true)\n",
      " |-- length: struct (nullable = true)\n",
      " |    |-- old: long (nullable = true)\n",
      " |    |-- new: long (nullable = true)\n",
      " |-- kafka_partition: integer (nullable = true)\n",
      " |-- kafka_offset: long (nullable = true)\n",
      " |-- event_ts: timestamp (nullable = true)\n",
      " |-- selisih_byte: long (nullable = true)\n",
      "\n",
      "temp view 'wiki_edits' registered: True\n",
      "Q3a — where length/selisih_byte are null (by event type)\n",
      "      type  rows_total  no_length_object  old_is_null  selisih_null\n",
      "-------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
      "      edit       27733                 0            0             0\n",
      "categorize       25164                 0        25164         25164\n",
      "       log        2978                 0         2978          2978\n",
      "       new        1903                 0         1903             0\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "'Q3a — where length/selisih_byte are null (by event type)\\n      type  rows_total  no_length_object  old_is_null  selisih_null\\n-------------------------------------------------------------------\\n      edit       27733                 0            0             0\\ncategorize       25164                 0        25164         25164\\n       log        2978                 0         2978          2978\\n       new        1903                 0         1903             0'"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 3,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "EVENT_SCHEMA = StructType([\n",
    "    StructField(\"id\",         LongType()),\n",
    "    StructField(\"type\",       StringType()),\n",
    "    StructField(\"wiki\",       StringType()),\n",
    "    StructField(\"server_name\", StringType()),\n",
    "    StructField(\"title\",      StringType()),\n",
    "    StructField(\"namespace\",  IntegerType()),\n",
    "    StructField(\"user\",       StringType()),\n",
    "    StructField(\"bot\",        BooleanType()),\n",
    "    StructField(\"minor\",      BooleanType()),\n",
    "    StructField(\"timestamp\",  LongType()),     # Unix epoch seconds\n",
    "    StructField(\"comment\",    StringType()),\n",
    "    StructField(\"length\", StructType([         # struct, may be absent entirely\n",
    "        StructField(\"old\", LongType()),\n",
    "        StructField(\"new\", LongType()),\n",
    "    ])),\n",
    "])\n",
    "print(EVENT_SCHEMA.simpleString())\n",
    "\n",
    "kafka_df = (spark.read.format(\"kafka\")\n",
    "            .option(\"kafka.bootstrap.servers\", BOOTSTRAP)\n",
    "            .option(\"subscribe\", TOPIC)\n",
    "            .option(\"startingOffsets\", \"earliest\")\n",
    "            .option(\"endingOffsets\", \"latest\")\n",
    "            .load())\n",
    "\n",
    "parsed = kafka_df.select(\n",
    "    F.from_json(F.col(\"value\").cast(\"string\"), EVENT_SCHEMA).alias(\"e\"),\n",
    "    F.col(\"partition\").alias(\"kafka_partition\"),\n",
    "    F.col(\"offset\").alias(\"kafka_offset\"))\n",
    "parsed.persist()                     # one Kafka read serves every count below\n",
    "\n",
    "n_msgs = parsed.count()\n",
    "bad = parsed.filter(F.col(\"e.wiki\").isNull()).count()\n",
    "print(f\"kafka messages read : {n_msgs:,}\")\n",
    "print(f\"null/unparsable     : {bad}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "edits = (parsed.select(\"e.*\", \"kafka_partition\", \"kafka_offset\")\n",
    "               .withColumn(\"event_ts\", F.col(\"timestamp\").cast(\"timestamp\"))\n",
    "               .withColumn(\"selisih_byte\",\n",
    "                           F.col(\"length.new\") - F.coalesce(F.col(\"length.old\"), F.lit(0)))\n",
    "               .filter(F.col(\"wiki\").isNotNull()))\n",
    "\n",
    "edits.cache()\n",
    "total = measure(sc, \"(a) materialise DataFrame\", lambda: edits.count())\n",
    "print(f\"rows in the snapshot: {total:,}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print()\n",
    "print(\"--- schema after the transformation (note event_ts: timestamp, selisih_byte: bigint) ---\")\n",
    "edits.printSchema()\n",
    "\n",
    "edits.createOrReplaceTempView(\"wiki_edits\")\n",
    "print(\"temp view 'wiki_edits' registered:\", spark.catalog.tableExists(\"wiki_edits\"))\n",
    "\n",
    "table(spark.sql(\"\"\"\n",
    "    SELECT type,\n",
    "           COUNT(*)                                   AS rows_total,\n",
    "           SUM(CASE WHEN length IS NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS no_length_object,\n",
    "           SUM(CASE WHEN length.old IS NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS old_is_null,\n",
    "           SUM(CASE WHEN selisih_byte IS NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS selisih_null\n",
    "    FROM wiki_edits GROUP BY type ORDER BY rows_total DESC\n",
    "\"\"\").collect(), [\"type\", \"rows_total\", \"no_length_object\", \"old_is_null\", \"selisih_null\"],\n",
    "      title=\"Q3a — where length/selisih_byte are null (by event type)\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "q3-05",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Q3b-1 — edits per minute for the top five wikis\n",
    "\n",
    "`date_trunc('minute', event_ts)` gives the bucket; the top five wikis are chosen by total\n",
    "edit volume first, then the minute series is produced only for those five (a `LIMIT`-ed\n",
    "subquery in `IN` would be ambiguous, a CTE is not).\n",
    "\n",
    "The pivot below prints the busiest minutes as a matrix, which is the readable form of\n",
    "\"edits per minute per wiki\".\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "id": "q3-06",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
