      "note: the snapshot contains two separate producer runs, so the minute series has a gap; nothing is missing inside a run (the KPI is edits per minute, not per captured minute)\n",
      "\n",
      "wiki                 commonswiki  dewiki  enwiki  frwiki  wikidatawiki\n",
      "minute                                                                \n",
      "2026-11-16 12:54:00          282      19      78      13           800\n",
